{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_009_03_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:58e91dcdcec6ba4f758d31b67e7b46ff975d47d9b34a7bd0284319e4c5c42c0c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb504a9413eb7ea7fba8ba01f3ed742a80a07d5f65fbb712355622b264eb23ce",
      "text": "哈啊、哈啊……不好意思，\n请从头再来一次！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8140d9ee36b65271b9d06b641f70797ccfdf307d42bb6e254d05dd839d0fe4bf",
      "text": "（……真了不起的家伙。毫不妥协，死咬着不放。\n和演唱会上不同的一面，哪怕姿态狼狈……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9433030d28da1cce98873bb39e5968219fdd124739e3d0f7861b697f088e9fda",
      "text": "（脑子里只想着让粉丝高兴，\n以及让演唱会成功）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d5f7ab8801af997b56ad62c64521981a51f898190fc40f8a124ed0692deb6ab",
      "text": "（演唱会上说过的那些话，每一句的份量都加重了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1728619fff4af09fbcadc568b388ffcd5dcab6cbc76163461e3790cee79e5db8",
      "text": "（看了这个便一目了然。偶像只有时刻努力、\n不断向上攀登的人才能当得起！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c1a80d62d19375662b96ffd224e6d5935a99c2792c50763b1cf5aef6a6ef3bb",
      "text": "（让我见识到了真正男儿的帅气）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:335c3324462354b4c7b5471c3a19060d0c8990adda86816067eb0e5924a13974",
      "text": "如果能通过315 Production的试镜，\n我也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:710b6e9280ffef58ae60cdd3ff565d337d387ed155e7fe7e9dc2755cf972c1fb",
      "text": "我们也会变成这样吗。\n感觉不赖。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07af0c9a4cd692d36f59e567e985937d43d0c7e4ad24aa35049631bd8ffc8c13",
      "text": "话虽如此……\n我居然为了以偶像为目标而在学习啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05612d263bab0cee21feddf53c01f2a88ab6b95d0df07be35c5a1888b969e5d5",
      "text": "呵，自从遇见朱雀之后，\n出乎意料的事还真是一桩接一桩啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
